    <newsTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[Top 5 Educational Books for Preschoolers in 2024: From Music to Math]]></Value>
    </newsTitle>
    <newsExcerpt>
      <Value><![CDATA[Five titles that hold a preschooler's attention and quietly build early numeracy, rhythm and vocabulary.]]></Value>
    </newsExcerpt>
    <newsBody>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>A good preschool book earns a second reading. These five did, in living rooms and classrooms alike, across the past year.</p><p>Each pick is grouped by the skill it builds, so you can match a book to whatever your child is working on right now.</p>]]></Value>
